<title>ITALY: Italian BTP future contract hits fresh high.</title>
<headline>Italian BTP future contract hits fresh high.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Italian BTP LIFFE September futures contract hit a new record high on Wednesday of 137.04, a rise of 78 basis points on the day.</p>
<p>The 10-year spread between cash BTPs and the benchmark Bund narrowed to a record 92 basis points.</p>
<p>Milan newsroom +392-66102321</p>
